Control-plane HTTP API (Raft-backed)
-----------------------------------

Start a control node (example):
  go run ./cmd/control --data-dir ./control-data --http-addr :8090 --node-id ctrl1 --enable-raft --raft-addr 127.0.0.1:12100

Endpoints:
  POST /v1/control/shards/assign
    body: {"shard_id":"0","nodes":["http://127.0.0.1:8080","http://127.0.0.1:8081"]}

  GET /v1/control/shards/get?shard_id=0
    returns JSON array of nodes

  GET /v1/control/shards
    returns JSON map of shardKey -> nodes array
